<title>FRANCE: Rexel buys Southland Electrical Supply.</title>
<headline>Rexel buys Southland Electrical Supply.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pinault-Printemps-Redoute said its Rexel unit's 50-percent owned U.S. subsidiary Rexel Inc had agreed to acquire Southland Electrical Supply of the U.S. for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Southland is a leading electrical equipment distributor in the state of Kentucky with a market share of around 10 percent. The buy will be completed in February.</p>
<p>Southland had 1996 sales of 320 million francs.</p>
</text>
